OL,3,GNEWSASearch for missing French
OL,4,Afishermen called off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search for two men missing from a
OL,7,FFrench fishing vessel that sank in the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel has been called off.
OL,10,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,11,F(MCA) said that despite an "extensive
OL,12,Fand intensive" effort, it was ending
OL,13,Fthe search for the men from the trawler
OL,14,FThe Maranello.
OL,16,FThe crew issued a distress call at at
OL,17,F18:00 BST on Saturday, sparking the
OL,18,Foperation over an area south-west of
OL,19,Fthe Eddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1788242208
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASearch for missing French
OL,4,Afishermen called off
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Based on all the information available
OL,7,Fand the known limits of human
OL,8,Fsurvivability in the water temperature,
OL,9,Fthe decision has been taken this
OL,10,Fmorning that the coastguard element of
OL,11,Fthe search for the two missing
OL,12,Ffishermen has now been officially
OL,13,Fconcluded," the MCA added.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
